    "description": {
      "value": "<p><em>You move in half-seen gaps between possible positions.</em></p><p>At the start of each of your turns, choose <strong>one creature</strong> you can see.</p><ul><li>Until the start of your next turn, your movement <strong>does not provoke opportunity attacks</strong> from that creature.</li><li>This effect ends early if you become <strong>Staggered</strong> or your movement is reduced to 0.</li></ul><p>You don’t dodge them; you simply walk where their memory of you isn’t.</p>",
